    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG O'DWYER HAVE THE PLEASURE IN BRINGING TO MARKET THIS WONDERFUL 6 BEDROOM DETACHED RESIDENCE ON 0.69 ACRES OF LANDSCAPED GARDENS"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 5.8m x 2.5m\n\n\nSitting Room - 5.0m x 4.2m\n\n\nLiving Room - 4.4m x 4.2m\n\n\nKitchen/dining room - 8.9m x 3.9m\n\n\nUtility Room - 2.1m x 1.4m\n\n\nWC - 1.8m x 1.4m\n\n\nBack Hall - 2.5m x 1.2m\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.9m x 3.4m\n\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - 2.6m x 2.6m\n\n\nLanding - 3.8m x 5.5m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.2m x 3.8m\n\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - 2.1m x 1.6m\n\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.2m x 3.3m\n\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.9m x 2.9m\n\n\nBedroom 5 - 3.5m x 2.9m\n\n\nBedroom 6 - 4.1m x 2.9m\n\n\nBathroom - 2.9m x 2.0m\n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Nestled in the picturesque countryside near the village of Stradone, this charming second-hand detached house offers a serene retreat from city life.</li><li> Boasting a generous 221 sq m of living space, this modern property features six bedrooms, two reception rooms, and four bathrooms, providing ample space for a growing family or those who love to entertain.</li><li> The house is characterized by its bright and inviting atmosphere, with modern amenities and well-maintained interiors throughout.</li><li> Situated on a spacious 0.69-acre plot, the property also offers a beautiful garden that is bordered by a idyllic stream, and off-street parking for added convenience. Whether you're looking for a peaceful rural escape or a comfortable family home, this property ticks all the boxes.</li><li> Alarm System Installed</li><li> Garden Shed</li><li> Oil Fired Central Heating</li><li> Biocycle Sewerage</li><li> Group Water Scheme</li><li> Built in Sauna</li><li> Year of Construction : 2003</li><li> Don't miss the opportunity to make this tranquil retreat your own.</ul>"
      },
      {
